# NeuroNexus A4x4-3mm-50-125-177 — neurosuite-3 probe configuration
# Catalog page 28
# 4 shanks, 4 sites/shank, 16 total channels
# Geometry fully enumerated: all 16 sites as [x_um, y_um]
#   x = lateral position from first shank tip (µm)
#   y = depth from shank tip (µm); sites ordered tip-to-base
